WO. Ellis is a teenaged [[Bestiary/Visitors from Beyond#Archlin|Archlin]] with an ill-fitting uniform and an obvious greenness when handling a [[Phenomena/Althane/Guns|firearm]].

Ellis is a member of Fort Sera and was present at the negotiations with [[Org/Althane/Red Dragon Rail Company|RDRco]] in the northern part of the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|Gulch]].
